sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor L as Lecturer
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as Supabase

  L->>UI: Open analytics for a course
  UI->>API: GET /api/analytics/:courseId
  API->>DB: Aggregate attempts + question metadata
  DB-->>API: Aggregated rows
  API-->>UI: CourseAnalytics (KPIs, score distribution, topic / Bloom / SOLO performance, cross-matrix, attempts)
  UI-->>L: Render dashboard
